      "status": "drafted",
      "confidence": "high",
      "judgment": false,
      "rule": "A single deep crowning cornice, projecting 1/12 to 1/16 of total facade height with projection at least equal to its own vertical dimension, ends the composition absolutely and throws the whole wall into a single band of shadow. No gable stands behind it and the roof is invisible from the street.",
